{"name":"Zanzibar","hex":"#7e6765","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Zanzibar","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["An island region of Tanzania in the Indian Ocean.","A former sultanate in East Africa in the Indian Ocean, which merged with Tanganyika in 1963 to form Tanzania."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Zanzibar"}],"entries":[{"title":"Zanzibar","blocks":[{"text":"Zanzibar is a Tanzanian semi-autonomous region off the coast of East Africa. It is located in the Indian Ocean, and consists of many small islands and two large ones: Unguja Island and Pemba Island. The capital is Zanzibar City, located on the island of Unguja. Its historic centre, Stone Town, is a UNESCO World Heritage Site."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d4/Flag_of_Zanzibar.svg/330px-Flag_of_Zanzibar.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zanzibar"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8b/The_old_castle_in_Zanzibar.JPG/500px-The_old_castle_in_Zanzibar.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8b/The_old_castle_in_Zanzibar.JPG/1280px-The_old_castle_in_Zanzibar.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8b/The_old_castle_in_Zanzibar.JPG/500px-The_old_castle_in_Zanzibar.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The castle in Zanzibar","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AThe_old_castle_in_Zanzibar.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c9/ZanzibarOmaniRuler.jpg/500px-ZanzibarOmaniRuler.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c9/ZanzibarOmaniRuler.jp